OL,3,GNEWSA#1m of 'illegally imported'
OL,4,Acigarettes seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1m of suspected illegally
OL,7,Fimported cigarettes have been seized by
OL,8,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC).
OL,10,FAn investigation is ongoing after
OL,11,F188,640 packets of cigarettes and
OL,12,F74.75kg (11st 10lb) of hand rolling
OL,13,Ftobacco were recovered from a house in
OL,14,FEasington Lane, Sunderland.
OL,16,FAll of the cigarettes and tobacco
OL,17,Frecovered by Northumbria Police and
OL,18,FSunderland City Council's trading
OL,19,Fstandards team last month are believed
OL,20,Fto be illegal.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
