OL,3,GNEWSA#1m of 'illegally imported'
OL,4,Acigarettes seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member Bill Blackett said: "The
OL,7,Fsale of illegal tobacco undermines
OL,8,Flegitimate local businesses, can fuel
OL,9,Forganised criminal activity, and can
OL,10,Fmake tobacco products more accessible
OL,11,Fto children and young people."
